(1 Introduction) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This document describes the account information interface of the synthetic Open Finance) Tj T*
(Framework version 2. Version 2 extends version 1.3 and keeps the version 1.3 interface) Tj T*
(available for existing TPPs.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Conventions) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The key words MUST, MUST NOT, SHALL, SHALL NOT, SHOULD and MAY are to be interpreted as) Tj T*
(normative requirement levels. Statements without these key words are informative.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
