(4.2 Read Transaction List) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Call GET /accounts/{accountId}/transactions reads the transaction list of an addressed) Tj T*
(account.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The query parameter bookingStatus is mandatory. The ASPSP SHALL support the values booked,) Tj T*
(pending and both. The ASPSP MAY support the values information and all. If the value) Tj T*
(information is used, the ASPSP SHALL return standing order information instead of) Tj T*
(transactions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The query parameter dateFrom is mandatory unless deltaList is used. The ASPSP SHALL reject a) Tj T*
(request without dateFrom with HTTP status 400 and error code FORMAT_ERROR.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The ASPSP SHALL support the pagination of transaction lists. The TPP MAY limit the page size) Tj T*
(with the query parameter pageSize. The ASPSP SHALL return a link next when more entries) Tj T*
(exist.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The ASPSP SHALL return HTTP status 429 with error code ACCESS_EXCEEDED when the access) Tj T*
(frequency limit of the consent is exceeded.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Each returned transaction MUST contain transactionAmount and bookingDate. The bookingDate is) Tj T*
(returned as date-time in version 2.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
