(4.3 Read Transaction Details) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Call GET /accounts/{accountId}/transactions/{transactionId} reads the details of one) Tj T*
(transaction. The ASPSP SHALL return HTTP status 404 if the transactionId is unknown.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.4 Read Balance) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Call GET /accounts/{accountId}/balances reads the balances of an account. The ASPSP SHALL) Tj T*
(return at least one balance of type closingBooked or interimAvailable.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
