(5 Error Codes) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FORMAT_ERROR \(400\): the request does not match the syntax of the interface.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PERIOD_INVALID \(400\): the requested period is outside the supported range.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CONSENT_INVALID \(401\): the consent was created but is not valid for the addressed service.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ACCESS_EXCEEDED \(429\): the access frequency limit of the consent is exceeded.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
